@startuml

title Avito.Кухня MVP — C4 Container Diagram

skinparam rectangle {
    BackgroundColor white
    BorderColor black
}

actor "Пользователь" as Customer

rectangle "Web Client" as Web {
    [Frontend MVP]
}

rectangle "Kitchen API" as API {
    [Public API]
    [Partner API]
    [Order Management]
}

database "PostgreSQL" as DB

rectangle "Restaurant Example" as Restaurant {
    [Restaurant API]
    [Webhook Endpoint]
}

Customer --> Web : Использует сервис

Web --> API : REST API
API --> DB : Чтение / запись

Restaurant --> API : Partner API\nсинхронизация меню\nсинхронизация остатков\nизменение статусов

API --> Restaurant : Webhook\norder.created

@enduml